  "comparisonFindings": [
    "Hypnotic Pattern/Slow retain their own sights, components and wake/resave rules; none is copied as a global rule.",
    "Silence blocks acoustics, whereas Mental Collapse also blocks intentional nonacoustic output and actual new spell commitments.",
    "Phantasmal Killer and Invisible Tide have different private-image/balance and damage/condition contracts; neither authorizes physical Reality Rewrite.",
    "Frost Nova is not evidence that every freeze is an elemental effect; Prism gets no automatic Frozen/Root/elemental classification.",
    "Uncontrollable Laughter and Blindness/Deafness retain their own genuine conditions, independent component defenses and cleanup.",
    "Counterspell uses actual class/ordinary access and paid pre-effect timing; no rank is inferred from price.",
    "Greater Dispel and Wizard class Dispel remain separate ranks/costs/checks. Only the actually acquired class Dispel is used positively here.",
    "Lesser Antimagic supplies actual initial prevention and later local suppression while preserving source clocks, histories and outside effects.",
    "Resource6 Return147 is accepted/applied comparison evidence only. Pending comparison proposals grant no global authority."
  ],
  "historicalSourceFindingsUnchanged": [
    "Prism freezes one creature in place for one round with WIS save ends; no named condition or temporal-clock suspension is supplied.",
    "Presence requires enemies actually seeing the caster, a WIS save and one-round Paralyzed. New observer triggers cannot be inferred from Instantaneous metadata.",
    "Power Word preserves150HP or less and actual Stunned; initial save, lifetime and precise HP measurement remain source decisions.",
    "Mental Collapse forbids all communication and spellcasting for one minute; it is broader than acoustic Silence and narrower than unspecified loss of all agency.",
    "Reality Rewrite changes one recipient’s experience and applies WIS-or-Stunned; it grants no physical reality or history rewrite.",
    "Current condition overlay applies the shared source-character/target/encounter guard across classes, spells and companions; source prevention and later suppression remain distinct.",
    "True Seeing and Hold Monster remain pending; their proposed rules do not govern these five identities."
